---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ESPERE! Recado Importante (Etapa 2 de 3)"
  description="Recado importante da NTR Escola de Motores."
  noindex={true}
  contentType="upsell"
  contentSlug="convite"
>
  {/* Header de Atenção */}
  <div class="border-b-4 border-[#CC0000] bg-black px-4 py-6 text-center text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <h1 class="mb-4 animate-pulse text-2xl leading-tight font-black md:text-4xl">
        ATENÇÃO!!! Não feche a página antes de concluir ou isso pode causar erros
      </h1>

      {/* Barra de Progresso Animada */}
      <div class="relative mx-auto h-8 max-w-md overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-black/40 p-1">
        <div class="progress-bar relative z-10 flex h-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#F0B102] text-[10px] font-black text-black uppercase md:text-xs">
          Etapa 2 de 3
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="min-h-screen bg-[#050505] px-4 py-12 text-white md:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
      <p class="mb-8 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-gray-400 uppercase italic">
        Assista o vídeo que tenho um recado importante:
      </p>

      {/* VSL Container - Proporção Vertical 9:16 */}
      <div class="relative mx-auto mb-12 w-full max-w-[400px] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border-4 border-white/10 bg-black shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(255,51,51,0.1)]">
        <div style="position:relative;padding-top:177.77777777777777%;">
          <iframe
            id="panda-f43bc79b-2817-4d25-b630-490d80605b70"
            title="Recado importante Clube NTR"
            src="https://player-vz-8c69785c-727.tv.pandavideo.com.br/embed/?v=f43bc79b-2817-4d25-b630-490d80605b70"
            style="border:none;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;"
            allow="accelerometer;gyroscope;autoplay;encrypted-media;picture-in-picture"
            allowfullscreen={true}
            width="100%"
            height="100%"
            fetchpriority="high"
          >
           </iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Botões de Decisão - Com delay de 60s */}
      <div id="upsell-actions" class="hidden translate-y-4 transform transition-all duration-1000">
        {/* Botão SIM - Upsell */}
        <div class="mb-10">
          <a
            href="https://sun.eduzz.com/1143144?cupom=CLUBEUP&u=1"
            class="inline-block w-full max-w-xl transform animate-bounce rounded-2xl bg-[#22C55E] px-8 py-6 text-center text-xl leading-tight font-black tracking-[0.05em] text-white uppercase italic shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(34,197,94,0.3)] transition-all hover:-translate-y-2 hover:bg-[#16a34a] hover:shadow-[0_15px_50px_rgba(34,197,94,0.5)] md:text-2xl"
          >
            SIM, QUERO ENTRAR NO CLUBE NTR
          </a>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-4 flex max-w-lg items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm leading-tight font-bold text-gray-300 md:text-base">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-green-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            Ao clicar no botão acima todos os conteúdos do Clube NTR serão adicionados ao seu pedido
            por apenas R$ 39,90/mês
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Botão NÃO - Downsell (Versão Botão Vermelho Claro) */}
        <div class="mt-16 border-t border-white/5 pt-10 pb-12">
          <a
            href="/calculadora-up/"
            class="mb-3 inline-block w-full max-w-md rounded-xl border border-[#EF4444]/20 bg-[#EF4444]/10 px-6 py-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-wider text-[#EF4444]/80 uppercase transition-all hover:bg-[#EF4444]/20"
          >
            Não quero participar do Clube NTR
          </a>
          <p class="text-[10px] leading-relaxed tracking-widest text-gray-500 uppercase">
            Ao clicar aqui, você perderá essa oportunidade única para sempre.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    // Delay de 60 segundos (60000ms) para mostrar os botões
    setTimeout(() => {
      const actions = document.getElementById("upsell-actions");
      if (actions) {
        actions.classList.remove("hidden");
      }
    }, 60000);
  </script>

  <style>
    /* Estilos específicos para a página de Upsell */
    :global(body) {
      background-color: #050505 !important;
      color: white !important;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .progress-bar {
      width: 33%;
      animation: fill-progress 2s ease-out forwards;
      animation-delay: 0.5s;
    }

    @keyframes fill-progress {
      from {
        width: 33%;
      }
      to {
        width: 66%;
      }
    }

    .animate-pulse {
      animation: pulse 2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.6, 1) infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%,
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 0.8;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
